         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Exclamation mark, go and stop traffic neon signs set. Road signs or warnings design. Night bright neon sign, colorful billboard, light banner. Vector illustration in neon style.</rdf:li>
